#: payments/gc_eps.php:39 payments/gc_eps.php:41 payments/gc_eps.php:111 payments/gc_eps.php:187
msgid "eps - online bank transfer (AT)"
msgstr "eps - transferencia en línea (AT)"

#: payments/gc_eps.php:50
msgid ""
"With eps online transfer you pay simply, fast and secure by online banking of your bank. Your will be redirected to the online banking at your bank "
"where you authorize the credit transfer with PIN and TAN."
msgstr ""
"Con la transferencia electrónica eps usted paga de manera simple, rápida y segura mediante la banca electrónica de su banco en Austria. Será "
"redirigido directamente a su cuenta de banca electrónica donde autorizará la transferencia con su PIN y TAN."

#: payments/gc_eps.php:104
msgid "Enable eps - online bank transfer (AT)"
msgstr "Habilitar eps - transferencia en línea (AT)"

#: payments/gc_eps.php:188
msgid "GiroCheckout eps payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout eps"

#: payments/gc_giropay.php:39 payments/gc_giropay.php:41 payments/gc_giropay.php:110 payments/gc_giropay.php:186
msgid "giropay - online bank transfer"
msgstr "giropay - transferencia en línea"

#: payments/gc_giropay.php:50
msgid ""
"With giropay you pay simply, fast and secure by the online banking of your participating bank. You will be redirected to the online banking of your "
"bank where you authorize the credit transfer."
msgstr ""
"Con giropay usted paga de manera simple, rápida y segura por medio de la banca electrónica de su banco. Será redirigido directamente a su cuenta de "
"banca electrónica donde autorizará la transferencia con su PIN y TAN."

#: payments/gc_giropay.php:103
msgid "Enable giropay - online bank transfer"
msgstr "Habilitar giropay - transferencia en línea"

#: payments/gc_giropay.php:187
msgid "GiroCheckout giropay payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout giropay"

#: payments/gc_ideal.php:41 payments/gc_ideal.php:43 payments/gc_ideal.php:140 payments/gc_ideal.php:218
msgid "iDEAL - online bank transfer (NL)"
msgstr "iDEAL - transferencia en línea (NL)"

#: payments/gc_ideal.php:52
msgid ""
"With iDEAL you pay simply, fast and secure by online banking of your bank. You will be redirected to the online banking of your bank where you "
"authorize the credit transfer with PIN and TAN."
msgstr ""
"Con la transferencia electrónica eps usted paga de manera simple, rápida y segura mediante la banca electrónica de su banco en Austria. Será "
"redirigido directamente a su cuenta de banca electrónica donde autorizará la transferencia con su PIN y TAN."

#: payments/gc_ideal.php:133
msgid "Enable iDEAL - online bank transfer (NL)"
msgstr "Habilitar iDEAL - transferencia en línea (NL)"

#: payments/gc_ideal.php:219
msgid "GiroCheckout iDEAL payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout iDEAL"

#: payments/gc_maestro.php:41 payments/gc_maestro.php:42 payments/gc_maestro.php:120 payments/gc_maestro.php:197
msgid "Maestro"
msgstr "Maestro"

#: payments/gc_maestro.php:51
msgid ""
"Maestro is your ATM banking card that you can now use to pay online. It's a debit facility, so you can never spend more with your Maestro card than "
"you have in your bank account."
msgstr ""
"Maestro es su tarjeta bancaria que usa en el cajero automático y que ahora también puede utilizar para realizar pagos en línea.  Es una tarjeta de "
"débito, de modo que nunca puede gastar más de lo que tiene disponible en su cuenta bancaria."

#: payments/gc_maestro.php:113
msgid "Enable Maestro"
msgstr "Habilitar Maestro"

#: payments/gc_maestro.php:198
msgid "GiroCheckout Maestro payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout Maestro"

#: payments/gc_paydirekt.php:49 payments/gc_paydirekt.php:50 payments/gc_paydirekt.php:132 payments/gc_paydirekt.php:226
msgid "Paydirekt"
msgstr "giropay/paydirekt"

#: payments/gc_paydirekt.php:61
msgid ""
"The online payment method of the German banks and Sparkassen. You will be redirected to the Paydirekt web site, where you will log into your "
"personal account and authorize the payment. You require prior registration with Paydirekt. This payment method only works with German banking "
"accounts."
msgstr ""
"El método de pago online de los bancos alemanes.  Será redirigido a la página de Paydirekt, donde debe iniciar sesión con sus datos de acceso "
"personales y luego confirmar el pago. Requiere un registro previo con Paydirekt."

#: payments/gc_paydirekt.php:125
msgid "Enable Paydirekt"
msgstr "Habilitar giropay/paydirekt"

#: payments/gc_paydirekt.php:227
msgid "GiroCheckout Paydirekt payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout paydirekt"

#: payments/gc_sofortuw.php:39 payments/gc_sofortuw.php:40 payments/gc_sofortuw.php:111 payments/gc_sofortuw.php:188
msgid "SOFORT Überweisung"
msgstr "Transferencia SOFORT"

#: payments/gc_sofortuw.php:50
msgid ""
"Direct payment via online banking. Make payments the easy way with your own online banking details – fast and direct. You will be redirected to the "
"web site of SOFORT, where you will enter your banking data and initiate the electronic wire transfer."
msgstr ""
"Con la transferencia SOFORT el pago en línea es más fácil que nunca.  Usted usa cómodamente los datos de conexión de siempre para su banca "
"electrónica.  Será redirigido al sitio web de SOFORT, donde deberá ingresar sus credenciales de banca electrónica e iniciar así la transferencia."

#: payments/gc_sofortuw.php:104
msgid "Enable SOFORT Überweisung"
msgstr "Habilitar transferencia SOFORT"

#: payments/gc_sofortuw.php:189
msgid "GiroCheckout SOFORT-Überweisung payment"
msgstr "GiroCheckout transferencia SOFORT"

